count</span></button></div><section class="_layoutResponsiveThirds_10rwz_207 _marketingPods_10rwz_277"><div id="marketingPod1" class="rmds_card _imagePod_bpaoh_29 rmds_card__borderRadius--m rmds_card__hierarchy--primary" data-testid="article-elem"><a href="/agent-valuation"><picture><img src="https://media.rightmove.co.uk/home_eval.jpg" alt="image of an agent visiting a house" data-testid="pod-img" class="_image_bpaoh_29" srcSet=""/></picture><div class="_category_bpaoh_39 _categoryDark_bpaoh_56">VALUATION</div><h3>Free home valuation</h3><p>Find out how much your home&#x27;s worth from an expert</p><div class="_linkContent_bpaoh_76">Get a free agent valuation</div></a></div><div id="dreamPropertiesPod" class="rmds_card _imagePod_bpaoh_29 rmds_card__borderRadius--m rmds_card__hierarchy--primary" data-testid="article-elem"><a href="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/news/articles/property-news/current-uk-mortgage-rates/"><picture><img src="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/news/content/uploads/2026/01/BoardwalkBristolResized-740x400.jpg" alt="Rightmove’s Property News" data-testid="pod-img" class="_image_bpaoh_29" srcSet=""/></picture><div class="_category_bpaoh_39 _categoryDark_bpaoh_56">Property News</div><h3>What are the current UK mortgage rates?</h3><p>Check the average 2 and 5-year fixed rates for a range of deposit sizes.</p><div class="_linkContent_bpaoh_76">Take a look</div></a></div><div id="dreamPropertiesPod" class="rmds_card _imagePod_bpaoh_29 rmds_card__borderRadius--m rmds_card__hierarchy--primary" data-testid="article-elem"><a href="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/mortgages/guides/first-time-buyers/ "><picture><img src="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/news/content/uploads/2026/05/FirstTimeBuyerGuides-740x400.jpg" alt="Rightmove’s Property News" data-testid="pod-img" class="_image_bpaoh_29" srcSet=""/></picture><div class="_category_bpaoh_39 _categoryDark_bpaoh_56">First-time buyers</div><h3>First-time homebuyer guides</h3><p>Feel confident in what you can afford and under